From b9fb226e9f8d68c8d76a7ba4d338b8750e402325 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin Tahai <justintahai@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 09:51:05 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 30/30] TAHAI: snapshot native Windows 2.0.32 release source

Capture native workspace rail, adjustable layouts, named workspaces, Local OI, Guard, Skin package management, policies, pinned Rust dependencies, focused regressions, and fail-closed MSIX packaging evidence.

Windows native Chromium only. Mobile changes, build outputs, profiles, local evidence logs, and the unsigned MSIX remain outside this commit. Package version 2.0.32.0 was supplied explicitly to the packager; signing, Store certification, and full installed-package acceptance remain separate.
